  "worked_solution": "Using the distributive law, we multiply each term inside the parentheses by the number \n$(-8):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-8(5p+2q) & = \\\\ (-8)\\cdot 5p+(-8)\\cdot 2q & = \\\\ (-40p)+(-16q) & = \\\\ -40p-16q\\end{aligned}\n$$",
